1
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:06,740
So it's Friday night.

2
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:11,940
I'm a young college student at this time. I'm attending a party at another university.

3
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:14,520
I'm making my way through this party...

4
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:18,300
...and I notice that there's this guy standing

5
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:22,220
a distance away from me, and he's just staring at me.

6
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:26,380
I don't pay it any attention. I keep doing my thing.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,400
Every now and then, I look up and the guy is a little bit closer--still staring at me.

8
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,700
I still don't pay it any attention.

9
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:38,960
At one point, I'm talking to someone when suddenly, I hear these words behind me:

10
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,960
"What did you say?"

11
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:45,600
I turned around and it's this guy--standing right in my face.

12
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:48,880
I turned back around to look at the guy that I was talking to

13
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,740
to see if he was talking to him by any chance

14
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:53,740
and then I turned back to look at him.

15
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:55,440
And I was like "Are you talking to me?"

16
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:57,760
And he was like "Yeah! What did you say?"

17
00:00:57,760 --> 00:01:00,960
And I was like "I didn't say anything to you."

18
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:06,120
And as soon as I said that, this guy takes his fist and *BOOM*--right in my face.

19
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:08,120
My head snaps back.

20
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,220
And I'm like--

21
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:13,220
--I don't respond.

22
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:16,340
I look around and I suddenly notice

23
00:01:16,340 --> 00:01:21,780
that he's got his friends surrounding me -- I estimate probably 20 of them.

24
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:26,080
And I'm thinking to myself "Things are about to go down."

25
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,960
"This is not good."

